{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>For all flesh had corrupted its way.</b> Its mating — like the way of a man with a young woman. And they had already been commanded, 'Let the earth bring forth living creatures למינה, beasts and creeping things and חיתו ארץ למינהו' — but not with one not of its kind. Therefore, 'I will destroy them with the earth' — measure for measure." "<b>All flesh.</b> But not fish, for no decree was decreed upon the fish of the sea. This is what is written: 'from all that is in the dry land, they died.'"], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:03:12.130696812Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}